{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_012_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b05dc0e3911b7fcc7f46e34f8284b31030746b5deb22e7553fc9f0cd2bf3f1bc",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8e2a0625f120797019c0dde689883e81ef6f67fe2fdbf8dd7a493b8dd68b96c",
      "text": "锵锵——，白色情人节快乐！\n给，这是巧克力的回礼哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95af68bd34cb5a06b069478afd194e7627da1f571f4746a24eb6422592258931",
      "text": "自从吃了那盒巧克力，状态就超级好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b339d8123f109d72e5d4f78f8fe19f33a36903a55d93f869a68e059d596b6940",
      "text": "在前阵子的演出里，我也在绝妙的时机\n完成了绝妙的杂技表演哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d7fb8078121dc536bce2819cbd4b467a1a7d9d93c1ea1539acb0f1c79e3830f",
      "text": "这也多亏了●●●●●●●●●●监督呢♪ \n嘿嘿，谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7477a26c9cd08ddd87f73c0865a18fc282cb35117d6971a0a016a5c6d92dd2d2",
      "text": "我还跟享介商量着，下次要做更厉害的表演呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7ad141a98143650014094013b51c2d3438e54f8216aabe2d0dcda437ed9a3e4",
      "text": "接下来要去开会，监督也一起来嘛。\n让你听听超棒的点子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50258001da1657e8f0872865693df8d34a4eaa562e534f3791a0c4663792550c",
      "text": "辛苦啦！\n喂喂，你知道今天是什么日子吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c88a20739df46879744a74d7da2efaf0eb15fee85542cc1c1a2a581d3f2e557a",
      "text": "正确答案是……白色情人节～！所以呢，\n这是给●●●●●●●●●●监督的礼物♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bf2045e31f21dccb76d51c76b91d9119b8957c96ccda08ac7850e73d2fb0cea",
      "text": "情人节时说好了要送你最棒的礼物的对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a27dfca5b2715768fe51029e95e2f90a32d75522d4455d7761e4816c505b697f",
      "text": "我琢磨了好多送什么好呢。\n要是平时就会去跟享介商量了，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93b4520a20b352883fb97f2969e18e45bd05dc67fbf72760e8a3fb876fe8c0b6",
      "text": "果然还是想把我自己好好考虑挑选出来的东西\n交给你嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1aee2a5d40db21a6ac2314a3a8a7ef598f28f93e37d18575674e30f23bd3a93e",
      "text": "所以我超认真地琢磨过，最后选了这个哦。\n你能喜欢的话就太好啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_b:cmd-000047:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f7bb5c7046c3f11c4fab9e4cf5a89d5e3f37bb9c17eb29107adc409d005e5a8",
      "text": "悠介先生送的礼物，我会好好珍惜的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_b:cmd-000048:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7769d9fe85cf4410b66aaa2cb0d59b6f59a6c9fd67325be17cc761fc50f60743",
      "text": "原来为我考虑了这么多啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:951ea537ebf47be5983e0a1aa99a9b19f21b207e3bdec04d153b48ac0c287bb9",
      "text": "嘿嘿，太好啦！\n你能高兴，我也超级开心啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_012_22:5_02_012_22_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:951ea537ebf47be5983e0a1aa99a9b19f21b207e3bdec04d153b48ac0c287bb9",
      "text": "嘿嘿，太好啦！\n你能高兴，我也超级开心啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
